  rung 0  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma diag)   logL = -600.7683523463

=== Entry gate: the factorisation contract ===

At r = 0 with diagonal Phi, Theta and Sigma the likelihood factorises,
so the joint fit must equal the sum of the univariate fits exactly.

  univariate 1 (p=2, q=0)   logL =    -305.0645753028
  univariate 2 (p=2, q=0)   logL =    -295.7037770435
                                 sum  =    -600.7683523463
                                 joint=    -600.7683523463
  (both sides untruncated; the fit's own logL, xi truncated at 1e-03, is -600.7683523463)

  crossing identity (joint - sum) = -1.251e-12   (tolerance 1.0e-06)   VERIFIED
  rung 1  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma free)   logL = -594.0154436793
  rung 2  (F free, Theta free, Sigma free)   logL = -574.7207881378

